sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Player Client
    participant API as Control Plane<br/>engine-api
    participant DB as SurrealDB
    participant GS as Game Server / Room

    Note over API,DB: Operator already created<br/>quest_definition via /v2/console/quests

    GS->>API: POST /v2/events (server key)<br/>{ events: [{ user_id, name: "wins", value: 1 }] }
    API->>DB: increase player_stat(user, "wins")
    API->>DB: re-project player_quest progress
    opt goal crossed
        API-->>GS: completed quest + quest.completed webhook
    end

    P->>API: GET /v2/quest
    API->>DB: definitions + stats + seasons + IAP entitlements
    API-->>P: quests[] with progress + state

    P->>API: POST /v2/quest/claim<br/>{ quest_key }
    API->>DB: flip player_quest to claimed
    API->>DB: pay currency + items (idempotent seed)
    API-->>P: reward

    Note over P,API: second claim refuses<br/>already claimed
